    skos:note "Forest: as defined by the Forest Practices Code of British Columbia Act includes all of the following - forest land, whether Crown land or private land; Crown range; Crown land or private land that is predominantly maintained in one or more successive stands of trees, successive crops of forage, or wilderness"@en .

ex:Def_def_can_unknown_1069 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "In British Columbia, provincial forests and other unalienated Crown lands for wh..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Canada ;
    ex:country "Canada" ;
