    skos:note "The natural or artificial restocking (i.e., planting, seeding) of an area with forest trees. Also called forest regeneration. [Source: Glossary of Forestry Terms, Province of British Columbia, Ministry of Forests, via Igor A. Yakovlev]"@en .

