    skos:note "The Chilean Designated National Authority (CONAMA) adopted the below definition as the forest thresholds for afforestation and reforestation Clean Development Mechanism project activities: - A single minimum tree crown cover of 25 % - A single minimum plantation area of 0.5 hectare - A single minimum tree height of 5 meters and"@en .

