    ex:sectionSub "3.6.2 By any method" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "3.5 REFORESTATION - Reforestation is sorted by restoration of land cover and land cover and use. Several specified the planting of \"crops.\"" ;
    skos:note "A set of measures resulting in the development of a new generation of forest stand. [Source: Act on Forests and Amendments to Some Acts (the Forest Act) dated 3 November 1995. Ministry of Agriculture of the Czech Republic. Prague, 1996. 58 pp. From: \"Maksym Polyakov\" <mpoliak@pcomp.usau.kiev.ua Date: Mon, 15 Jun 1998 11:32:47 +0300 (MSD)]"@en .

ex:Def_def_cze_1995_1710_criteria ex:minHeight "1995.0"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minHeightSI "1995.0"^^xsd:float .

ex:Def_def_cze_1995_1718 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "Forest management – The regeneration, protection, tending and felling of forest ..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Czech_Republic ;
    ex:country "Czech Republic" ;
    ex:definitionType "Ecological/Miscellaneous" ;
    ex:geographicScope "Local/State" ;
    ex:hasCriteria ex:Def_def_cze_1995_1718_criteria ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    ex:sectionMain "3.6 REGENERATION" ;
    ex:sectionSub "3.6.3 Questions:" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "3.5 REFORESTATION - Reforestation is sorted by restoration of land cover and land cover and use. Several specified the planting of \"crops.\"" ;
    skos:note "Forest management – The regeneration, protection, tending and felling of forest stands and other activities securing the fulfillment of forest functions, [Source: Act on Forests and Amendments to Some Acts (the Forest Act) dated 3 November 1995. Ministry of Agriculture of the Czech Republic. Prague, 1996. 58 pp. From: \"Maksym Polyakov\" <mpoliak@pcomp.usau.kiev.ua Date: Mon, 15 Jun 1998 11:32:47 +0300 (MSD)]"@en .

ex:Def_def_cze_1995_1718_criteria ex:minHeight "1995.0"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minHeightSI "1995.0"^^xsd:float .

ex:Def_def_cze_1995_840 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "Forest stands with its environment and land designated for the fulfillment of fo..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Czech_Republic ;
    ex:country "Czech Republic" ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Use" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasCriteria ex:Def_def_cze_1995_840_criteria ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    ex:sectionMain "2.3 FOREST/FOREST LAND" ;
    ex:sectionSub "2.3.3 National definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.3 As a land use type" ;
    skos:note "Forest stands with its environment and land designated for the fulfillment of forest functions. Forest functions shall mean benefits towards the general well-being of the society conditional on the existence of forests, which consist of wood-producing and non-wood-producing functions. Forest stands shall mean trees and shrubs of forest tree species which, in their particular environment, fulfil forest functions. [Source: Act on Forests and Amendments to Some Acts (the Forest Act) dated 3 November 1995. Ministry of Agriculture of the Czech Republic. Prague, 1996. 58 pp. From: \"Maksym Polyakov\" <mpoliak@pcomp.usau.kiev.ua Date: Mon, 15 Jun 1998 11:32:47 +0300 (MSD)] and"@en .

ex:Def_def_cze_1995_840_criteria ex:minHeight "1995.0"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minHeightSI "1995.0"^^xsd:float .

ex:Def_def_cze_1997_841 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "Land destined to fulfill the forest functions, that is: (a) land with forest sta..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Czech_Republic ;
    ex:country "Czech Republic" ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Use" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasCriteria ex:Def_def_cze_1997_841_criteria ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    ex:sectionMain "2.3 FOREST/FOREST LAND" ;
    ex:sectionSub "2.3.3 National definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.3 As a land use type" ;
    skos:note "Land destined to fulfill the forest functions, that is: (a) land with forest stands and land after clear cutting ready for reforestation, forest line and soft road of a width less than 4 m; (b) forest roads, water surfaces, land above timber line and other land serving for forest management. Minimum area is 0.01 ha with a minimum width of 20 m and with no definition on crown cover or stand density. (European Communities 1997b - p. 1225)"@en .

ex:Def_def_cze_1997_841_criteria ex:minArea "0.01"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minAreaSI "0.01"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minHeight "4.0"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minHeightSI "4.0"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minWidth "4.0"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minWidthSI "4.0"^^xsd:float .

ex:Def_def_cze_2004_431 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "Forest land: land with forest stands and land after cutting ready for reforestat..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Czech_Republic ;
    ex:country "Czech Republic" ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Cover" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasCriteria ex:Def_def_cze_2004_431_criteria ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    ex:sectionMain "2.3 FOREST/FOREST LAND" ;
    ex:sectionSub "2.3.3 National definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.2 As a land cover type" ;
    skos:note "Forest land: land with forest stands and land after cutting ready for reforestation, forest line and soft roads of width less than 4 m. Forest roads, water surfaces, land above timber line and other land serving for forest management. Minimum area is 0.01 ha and with a minimum width of 20 m. NIL definition: Forest - areas (subplot), which are forest land as defined in the Forest Act No. 289/95 Coll. § 3, paragraph 1, letter a) and the Ministry of Agriculture Decree No. 84/1996 (which are divided into forest land stand soil and forest-free areas). Are also included in this category sites that have the character of the forest and not defined in the above legislation (e.g. forests on agricultural land). Ustav pro Hospodarskou Upravu Lesu (UHUL), 2004"@en .

