    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.3 As a land use type" ;
    skos:note "definition of forest is given by law: \"Forest land is land destined to fulfil the forest functions that is: land with forest stands and land after clear cutting ready for reforestation, forest line and soft road of a width less than 4 m; forest roads, water surfaces, land above timber line and other land serving for forest management.\" The Czech forest management instructions give 0.01 ha as a minimum area of forest, with a minimum width of 20 m. (CarboInvent JRC"@en .

