    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.3 As a land use type" ;
    skos:note "Land with tree crown cover (or equivalent stocking level) of more than 10% and area of more than 0.5 ha. The trees should be able to reach a minimum height of 5 m at maturity in situ. Areas with agricultural production and urban land are not included.FOREST EUROPE, UNECE AND FAO, 2011"@en .

