    skos:note "By legal definition, \"forest\" means a site of woody vegetation with an area of at least 0,5 ha, and at least one of the following requirements: Trees with the height of at least 1,3 m and with the canopy coverage of at least 30 %. If the site is managed for obtaining timber or other forest products"@en .

