    skos:note "Forest area is \"areas with crown cover (stand density) greater than around 20% of the area. Continuous forest with trees usually reaching a height of more than 7 metres and providing a source of wood"@en .

ex:Def_def_eur_unknown_103_criteria ex:minCanopyCover "20.0"^^xsd:float ;
    ex:minCanopyCoverSI "20.0"^^xsd:float ;
