    ex:sectionMain "2.3 FOREST/FOREST LAND" ;
    ex:sectionSub "2.3.3 National definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.2 As a land cover type" ;
    skos:note "An area with a plant cover that provides wood and nonagricultural plant products and which shelters wildlife and directly or indirectly affects the soil, climate or water supply"@en .

