    skos:note "Land with tree crown cover (or equivalent stocking level) of more than 10%and area of more than 0.5 ha. The trees should be able to reach a minimum height of 5 meters (m) at maturity in situ. FOREST EUROPE, UNECE AND FAO, 2011"@en .

