    ex:sectionSub "2.3.3 National definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.2 As a land cover type" ;
    skos:note "The 2003 forest cover analysis by the Forest Survey of India using satellite data, including forests of a defined area of more than 1 ha and 10% of tree canopy cover"@en .

