    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.1 As a declared, legal, or administrative unit" ;
    skos:note "‘forest’ means ‘any land covered with trees and undergrowth and includes all statutorily recognised forests, whether designated as reserve, protected or otherwise, and any land recorded as forests in the government records irrespective of the owners.’ India 2005"@en .

