    skos:note "The Act has defined forest land as land of any description falling within any forest area and includes most types of forests. The Scheduled Tribes and Other Traditional Forest Dwellers (Recognition of Forest Rights) Act, 2006"@en .

ex:Def_def_ind_2007_251 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "‘An area owned by Govt and notified as forest under any act or recorded as a for..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_India ;
