    skos:note "MoEF has proposed a definition that says forest is “an area under Government control notified or recorded as forest under any Act, for conservation and management of ecological and biological resources.”"@en .

ex:Def_def_ind_2007_253 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "“An area under Government control notified or recorded as forests under any Act ..." ;
