ex:Def_def_lit_unknown_908 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "Forest land - areas of land, covered by forest (stands) and without forests (cle..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Lithuania ;
    ex:country "Lithuania" ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Use" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    ex:sectionMain "2.3 FOREST/FOREST LAND" ;
    ex:sectionSub "2.3.3 National definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.3 As a land use type" ;
    skos:note "Forest land - areas of land, covered by forest (stands) and without forests (clear-cut, destructed areas, glades, nurseries, seed orchards, woody plants and special plantations for preparation of various raw materials). Forest land also includes forest roads, block lines, border lines, technological lines, antifire belts, timber yards, other areas for technological, recreational needs, game forage, also land nominated for afforestation. Source: A. Kuliesis, Director of Lithuanain Forest Inventory and Management Institute Email: Sekrtetore sek@mp.is.lt"@en .

ex:Def_def_lit_unknown_909 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "Forest land is land covered by forest stands or not covered by forest (cleared a..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Lithuania ;
    ex:country "Lithuania" ;
    ex:definitionType "Land Use" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    ex:sectionMain "2.3 FOREST/FOREST LAND" ;
    ex:sectionSub "2.3.3 National definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.3 As a land use type" ;
    skos:note "Forest land is land covered by forest stands or not covered by forest (cleared areas, perished stands, forest meadows, nurseries, seed-plots, seed orchards and raw shrubbery and plantations). Includes forest roads and drain ditches, forest compartment lines, technological and fire-prevention strips, piling places and facilities related to forest, rest spots, game feeding points, swamps, sands, as well as land for afforestation. Forest land may be forestry or conservation designated"@en .

ex:Def_def_mac_1997_592 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "Forest, as defined in this law, is land with forest types of trees and bushes, f..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Macedonia ;
