    ex:definitionType "Ecological/Miscellaneous" ;
    ex:geographicScope "Local/State" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Mumtaz_Ahmad_Section_Forest_Officer_Pakistan_Min ;
    ex:sectionMain "3.4 FORESTATION" ;
    ex:sectionSub "3.5.1 Restoration of Land Cover" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "3.5 REFORESTATION - Reforestation is sorted by restoration of land cover and land cover and use. Several specified the planting of \"crops.\"" ;
    skos:note "To restock felled or otherwise cleared woodland. Definition adopted from the British Commonwealth Forest Terminology Part-I, 1953. Source: Mumtaz Ahmad, Section Forest Officer, Pakistan Min. of Environment, Local Government, and Rural Development"@en .

