    ex:sectionSub "2.3.3 National definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.4 Ecological/Miscellaneous Definitions" ;
    skos:note "Forests are ecosystems, which include all living organisms (flora and fauna), as well as nonliving components (litter, soils, water, etc.)"@en .

