    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.1 As a declared, legal, or administrative unit" ;
    skos:note "Forest land - Definition of „Forests“ in the Forest Act includes: * Forest Stands * Other areas designated for forest production, nature reserves or part of National Park or listed in the nature conservation register * Forest infrastructure, and installations, including those for tourism"@en .

