    skos:note "Every portion of land with a greater than 2000 m2 and 15 m wide, is considered forest area. Forest area includes exploitable forests, recently harvested or burned areas, recent seedlings and plantations, and green zones (reserves, protection forests and recreation forests). (European Communities 1997b - p. 879)"@en .

