ex:Def_def_rom_unknown_1572 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "The act of installation, through artificial methods, of the forest vegetation on..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Romania ;
    ex:country "Romania" ;
    ex:definitionType "Ecological/Miscellaneous" ;
    ex:geographicScope "Local/State" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    ex:sectionMain "2.14 STAND" ;
    ex:sectionSub "3.1.2 Land Cover" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "3.1 AFFORESTATION - Afforestation may be a legal term or a process of stocking land. In the case of the latter, we group the definitions into those that imply a change in land cover only and those that imply a change in land cover and use. Four definitions specify \"crops\" implying that the trees will be later removed for commercial purposes. The time period for lands \"never having been forested\" vary from never to 30 to 100 years." ;
    skos:note "The act of installation, through artificial methods, of the forest vegetation on lands where forest was never present or it was removed for a long time. Sorin Sfirlogea <sorinsf@rosilva.ro National Forests Administration"@en .

ex:Def_def_rom_unknown_1612 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "The act of removing the forest vegetation from forest lands, without changing th..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Romania ;
    ex:country "Romania" ;
    ex:definitionType "Ecological/Miscellaneous" ;
    ex:geographicScope "Local/State" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    ex:sectionMain "3.2 DEFORESTATION" ;
    ex:sectionSub "3.2.2 As a change in land cover" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "3.1 AFFORESTATION - Afforestation may be a legal term or a process of stocking land. In the case of the latter, we group the definitions into those that imply a change in land cover only and those that imply a change in land cover and use. Four definitions specify \"crops\" implying that the trees will be later removed for commercial purposes. The time period for lands \"never having been forested\" vary from never to 30 to 100 years." ;
    skos:note "The act of removing the forest vegetation from forest lands, without changing the land destination (considering the administrative point of view). Sorin Sfirlogea <sorinsf@rosilva.ro National Forests Administration"@en .

ex:Def_def_rom_unknown_1677 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "The act of installation, through artificial methods, of the forest vegetation on..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Romania ;
    ex:country "Romania" ;
    ex:definitionType "Ecological/Miscellaneous" ;
    ex:geographicScope "Local/State" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    ex:sectionMain "3.4 FORESTATION" ;
    ex:sectionSub "3.5.1 Restoration of Land Cover" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "3.5 REFORESTATION - Reforestation is sorted by restoration of land cover and land cover and use. Several specified the planting of \"crops.\"" ;
    skos:note "The act of installation, through artificial methods, of the forest vegetation on lands where forest was recently removed. Sorin Sfirlogea <sorinsf@rosilva.ro National Forests Administration"@en .

ex:Def_def_rom_unknown_1719 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "Natural regeneration - (Romania) -The act of installation, through natural metho..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Romania ;
