    ex:sectionSubSub "3.5 REFORESTATION - Reforestation is sorted by restoration of land cover and land cover and use. Several specified the planting of \"crops.\"" ;
    skos:note "Natural regeneration - (Romania) -The act of installation, through natural methods, of the forest vegetation. Sorin Sfirlogea <sorinsf@rosilva.ro National Forests Administration"@en .

