    skos:note "Cover Min. Area (ha) = 0.05 Min. Crown Cover (%) = Min. Tree Height (m) = Min. Strip Width (m) = ns Excludes individual trees- riverine and windbelt trees- plantations- etc. Forest act (1994) -Forest means land overgrown with forest trees in the form of stands or other forest plants which provides any of the functions of a forest. Forest according to this Act also includes overgrown plots of land defined as forest in the spatial element of the forest management plan"@en .

