    ex:sectionSub "2.5 WOODS, WOODLAND, OTHER WOODED LANDS (OWL)." ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.4.4 Ecological/Miscellaneous Definitions" ;
    skos:note "Woodland - Tree canopy cover between 40-70%. A closed-to-open canopy community, typically consisting of a single tree canopy layer and a herb (grass) layer. Thompson 1996? field_guide.htm"@en .

