    ex:sectionMain "2.3 FOREST/FOREST LAND" ;
    ex:sectionSub "2.3.3 National definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.2 As a land cover type" ;
    skos:note "“Forest” means any ecosystem containing trees on forest land or any component of such an ecosystem, and includes land, water, air, woody vegetation and living organisms"@en .

