    ex:sectionSub "2.3.3 National definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.3 As a land use type" ;
    skos:note "Land suitable for wood production and not primarily used for other purposes. Potential yield under ideal management conditions at least 1 m3sk per hectare per year. Includes abandoned agricultural land and land user for grazing not yet covered by forest. Includes forest land with density of tree crowns = 0%. (UN/ECE 1992 p. 249)"@en .

