    skos:note "“Forest” means land including mountain, rivulet, marsh, canal, swamp, waterway, lagoon, island, and sea shore in which nobody acquired by law; “National Reserved Forest” means forest determined to be national reserved forest under the provisions of this Act; “"@en .

