    skos:note "The planting of forests on lands which have historically contained forests but which have since been converted to some other use. The report of Thailand's National Greenhouse Gas Inventory, 1990. \"Wilailak Pangtawaong\" wpangtaw@deqp.go.th"@en .

ex:Def_def_tha_1996_311 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "A community forest can be any area the community wants to be designated a commun..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Thailand ;
