    skos:note "A community forest can be any area the community wants to be designated a community forest whether it is within the limits of a conservation zone such as a national park, wildlife sanctuary, watershed area; or non-conservation zone such as a national forest or public use area. Thailand's Community Forest Act Draft"@en .

ex:Def_def_tha_2001_1448 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "Other wooded area; woodland. Area that has some forest characteristics but does ..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Thailand ;
    ex:country "Thailand" ;
    ex:definitionType "Ecological/Miscellaneous" ;
