    ex:sectionMain "2.3 FOREST/FOREST LAND" ;
    ex:sectionSub "2.3.1 General definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.1.2 As a land cover type" ;
    skos:note "A large area of land covered with trees and plants, usually larger than a wood, or the trees and plants themselves"@en .

