    skos:note "Land with an open cover of trees, the crowns of which do not form a thickly interlaced canopy, and which as a rule is leafless for some period during the year. Climbers may be present. file:///C:/Users/Owner/Downloads/Friis_Forest_vegetation.pdf"@en .

ex:Def_def_unk_1974_926 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "Sont qualifiés forêts, les terrains dont les fruits exclusifs ou principaux sont..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Unknown ;
