    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.1 As a declared, legal, or administrative unit" ;
    skos:note "The Governor may declare public land as Commonwealth Forests under section 3. Such areas shall be of particular interest for forestry use including development and protection of watersheds. These forests shall be controlled by the Secretary of Natural Resources. LEX-FAOC017870. PUERTO RICO: Puerto Rico Forest Act (No. 133 of 1975). Date of text: 01 July 1975"@en .

ex:Def_def_unk_1980_1445 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "(1980) An area on which trees often small and characteristically short-boled rel..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Unknown ;
