    ex:sectionSub "2.3.2 International definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.2.2 As a land cover type" ;
    skos:note "Land with tree crown cover (or equivalent stocking level) of more than 10% and area of more than 0.5 hectares (ha). The trees should be able to reach a minimum height of 5m at maturity in situ.\""@en .

