    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.2.2 As a land cover type" ;
    skos:note "items are most relevant for the present study: • Forest land: Forest is defined as “land with tree crown cover of more than 10 percent and area more than 0.5 ha.” Trees on the site are considered to be higher than 5 m"@en .

