    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.2.2 As a land cover type" ;
    skos:note "Land with tree a crown cover of more than 10 percent, and a tree height of at least five meters. An important distinction is made between closed (40% crown cover) and open (10 -40 % crown cover) forest. Note: There is another definition forest for FRA 2000 based on land use"@en .

