ex:Def_def_unk_2006_1047 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "Статья 5. Понятие леса - Использование, охрана, защита, воспроизводство лесов ос..." ;
    ex:appliesTo ex:Country_Unknown ;
    ex:definitionType "Ecological/Miscellaneous" ;
    ex:geographicScope "National" ;
    ex:hasSource ex:Source_Unknown ;
    ex:sectionMain "2.3 FOREST/FOREST LAND" ;
    ex:sectionSub "2.3.3 National definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.4 Ecological/Miscellaneous Definitions" ;
    skos:note "Статья 5. Понятие леса - Использование, охрана, защита, воспроизводство лесов осуществляются исходя из понятия о лесе как об экологической системе или как о природном ресурсе. Article 5. Definition of forest Utilization, protection, conservation and reforestation are carried out based on understanding forests as an ecological system or a natural resource. From Yelena Gordeeva, 3 June 2015. yelena.gordeeva@uhasselt.be See also"@en .

ex:Def_def_unk_2006_1407 a ex:Definition ;
    rdfs:label "Trees on land not defined as forest and other wooded land. This may include agri..." ;
