    ex:sectionSub "2.3.3 National definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.2 As a land cover type" ;
    skos:note "National definition: Forest is land spanning more than 0.3 ha with trees taller than 5 m and a canopy cover of more than 20%, or trees able to reach these thresholds in situ. Ministry of Agriculture of the Slovak Republic, 2009"@en .

