    ex:sectionSub "2.3.2 International definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.2.4 Ecological/Miscellaneous Definitions" ;
    skos:note "A forest ecosystem is defined as a dynamic complex of plant, animal and microorganism communities and the non-living environment acting as a functional unit within the forest environment"@en .

