    ex:sectionSub "2.5 WOODS, WOODLAND, OTHER WOODED LANDS (OWL)." ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.4.4 Ecological/Miscellaneous Definitions" ;
    skos:note "Other Land - Land considered as \"Other land\", that is predominantly agricultural or urban lands use and has patches of tree cover that span more than 0.5 hectares with a canopy cover of more than 10 percent of trees able to reach a height of 5 meters at maturity. It includes both forest and non-forest tree species (FAO, 2015)"@en .

