    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.4.4 Ecological/Miscellaneous Definitions" ;
    skos:note "Tree -The definition of a tree that most tree scholars recognize is \"a woody plant with a single erect perennial trunk that reaches at least 3 inches in diameter at breast height (DBH} when mature"@en .

