    skos:note "Afforestation / Forestation (Arabic : Tashjeer, French : Boisement/Reboisement) - Artificial creation (by man) of a forest on an land which has never been forested before, as far as man’s memory can remember, using seedlings, vegetative materials or seeds(sowing) Mohammed Ellatifi, m.ellatifi@ellatifi.8m.com"@en .

