    skos:note "Forest - (1) A community dominated by dense, extensive tree cover. (2) An area managed for producing timber and other products, or maintained under woody vegetation for such indirect benefits as protection of watersheds or recreation. (3) An area within an administrative boundary of a forest agency, whether having trees or not.(4) Land primarily devoted to trees"@en .

