    ex:sectionMain "2.3 FOREST/FOREST LAND" ;
    ex:sectionSub "2.3.3 National definitions" ;
    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.3 As a land use type" ;
    skos:note "A land cover/land use category that is at least 10 percent stocked by singlestemmed woody species of any size that will be at least 13 feet tall at maturity. Also included, for the NRI, is land bearing evidence of natural regeneration of tree cover and not currently developed for nonforest use"@en .

