    ex:sectionSubSub "2.3.3.2 As a land cover type" ;
    skos:note "Includes areas dominated by single-stemmed, woody vegetation unbranched 2 to 3 feet above the ground having a height greater than 6 meters (20 feet) (2004)"@en .

